    "Six categories. No payment at this stage, and submitting the form does not reserve a place.": "六个类别。现阶段无需付款,提交表格不代表预留名额。",
    "Read this first": "请先阅读",
    "The formal ticketing process is not open yet. This form records your interest and allows the summit team to send you confirmed information as it becomes available. There is no payment at this stage, and submitting the form does not reserve a place.": "正式购票流程尚未开放。本表格记录您的兴趣,并允许峰会团队在确认信息可用时向您发送。现阶段无需付款,提交表格不代表预留名额。",
    "Choose the category that best fits your role": "选择最符合您角色的类别",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Delegate</span>\n    <p>For tea-industry professionals, buyers, investors, researchers, technology providers and other participants attending the summit programme.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">代表</span>\n    <p>面向参加峰会议程的茶业专业人士、采购商、投资者、研究人员、技术供应商及其他参会者。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Exhibitor</span>\n    <p>For organisations interested in presenting products, equipment or services at the International Tea &amp; Technology Expo.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">参展商</span>\n    <p>面向有意在国际茶叶与技术博览会上展示产品、设备或服务的机构。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Sponsor</span>\n    <p>For organisations interested in Title, Platinum, Gold, Silver or Supporting Partner opportunities.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">赞助商</span>\n    <p>面向有意获得冠名、白金、金牌、银牌或支持伙伴机会的机构。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Government</span>\n    <p>For public officials, regulators, trade agencies, diplomatic missions, industry bodies and development institutions attending in an official capacity.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">政府</span>\n    <p>面向以官方身份参会的公职人员、监管机构、贸易机构、外交使团、行业团体及发展机构。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Media</span>\n    <p>For journalists, editors, producers, photographers and recognised industry media seeking accreditation.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">媒体</span>\n    <p>面向寻求认证的记者、编辑、制片人、摄影师及获认可的行业媒体。</p>",
